<title>USA: Digital Biometrics Q1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics Q1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said gains from lower expenses were offset by lower gross margins in the first quarter ended December 31, although net losses were trimmed.</p>
<p>The company said it lost $1.1 million in the period compared to a loss of $1.2 million one year ago. Sales fell to $2.0 million from $2.5 million in the period.</p>
<p>Digital Biometrics makes and markets identification systems.</p>
<p>Its shares closed unchanged Tuesday at 2-5/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
